    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45683" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφεστρίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίοος</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφέννυμι</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>upper garment,
			wrapper</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				4.38
			</span></i>; a philosopher's <i>mantle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				3.98a
			</span></i>; soldier's <i>cloak</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Luc.</u>
				28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶσα ἡ σύγκλητος μελαίναις ἐ. χρώμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					4.2.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				7.11.2
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>; also a woman's <i>robe,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				9.153
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλαμὺς ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				5.215c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>coverlet</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				10.42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
